{"data": {"job": {"id": 2836137, "title": null, "experience_from": 0.0, "experience_to": null, "description": "<div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Bartender</b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">We are looking for\na passionate, ambitious, reliable, and dedicated Bartender. You’ll ideally\nhave some experience with a background in busy restaurants and cocktail bars.\nAlong with your great service skills and creating remarkable drinks\nyou’ll be consistent, positive and willing to learn. </p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Be part of our team</b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Here at Brindisa, our food is homely and authentic, with flavour always being the key factor.\nAbove all our food is about sharing. We celebrate the culture and dining\nexperience of small plates. We have a direct relationship with all our\nsuppliers, bringing their ethos and quality to the table.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>We offer you:</b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</p><ul>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\">28\n     days holiday</li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\">35%\n     discounts in our restaurants and our retail offerings</li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\">staff\n     meals</li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\">childcare\n     vouchers</li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\">cycle\n     to work scheme</li><li class=\"MsoNormal\">refer a friend reward</li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\">the\n     opportunity to progress within the business across our sites</li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\">the\n     opportunity for trips to Spain to meet our producers <br></li>\n</ul></div>", "private_description": null, "estimated_start_date": null, "job_application_type": "CUSTOM", "deleted": false, "access_mode": "PUBLIC", "post_type": "PUBLIC", "duration_mode": "ONE_TIME", "type_code": "PUBLISHED", "template_id": 1145325, "start_date": "Thu, 08 Oct 2026 07:55:57 GMT", "alias_position": "Bartender", "language": null, "request_video_cover_letter": false, "third_party_tracking": null, "ats_email_template": null, "post_immediately"